    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2024_0509","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Lucía Eriksdóttir talks about a dot, considered at length. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</Description>
